jobs_results.description:
Talented has joined forces with a telecommunications company specializing in voice over IP (VoIP) services. They offer cloud-based communication solutions for both individuals and businesses. Their services include VoIP phone systems, virtual numbers, and unified communications, enabling users to make calls over the internet rather than traditional phone lines. The Engineering team is rapidly growing and they are faced with multiple challenges that go along with high performance, distributed systems and the processing of large volumes in real time.

They are looking for a Software Engineer with a solid background in: Java, Springboot and AWS. Your main purpose will be to transform the data pipeline to a real-time event-driven one. You will be designing and building software systems for their Global Network Platform. You will need to be able to write efficient, maintainable and well-structured code. This is a hands-on role!

Requirements:
• 4+ years of engineering skills in Java ... Springboot;
• experience with AWS;
• experience in writing and deploying code (Docker or K8s);

This role is fully remote within Spain. You have to be residing in Spain (no visa sponsorship). Would you like to find out more? Apply

